Error: Jet.CopyNotSupported: `SharedGuard<Int>` can't be copied
  --> Tests/UI/Ownership/shared_guard_is_owned_and_noncloneable.jet:4:8
    |
  4 |     _: guard.copy()
    |        ^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `SharedGuard<Int>` is `#MoveOnly`: its values move and never copy
 Fix: Move it instead with `.move()`; a second one has to come from wherever this one came from
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.CopyNotSupported
